{
  "statement": "As the EfficiencyAgent, I advocate for high performance in the ATM system. Requirements EFF-01 and EFF-02 are critical for ensuring user responsiveness and maintaining a high transaction throughput, which are essential for a smooth user experience. EFF-03 optimizes data retrieval, enhancing overall system efficiency. EFF-04 and EFF-05 ensure that transactions do not cause negative balances while facilitating automatic fund withdrawals, minimizing delays for users. EFF-06 provides immediate feedback on withdrawal requests, crucial for user trust. Finally, EFF-07 implements load balancing to manage transactions effectively, enhancing overall system performance. I oppose any requirements that compromise these performance goals.",
