      "ids": ["EFF-01", "GRN-01"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "EFF-01's requirement for rapid transaction processing could conflict with GRN-01's focus on minimizing energy consumption, as faster processing may increase energy use."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["EFF-03", "GRN-04"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "EFF-03's optimization for data retrieval may conflict with GRN-04's goal of minimizing data storage requirements, leading to potential data redundancy."
